data: {"id": "bc4c140538d4403b-thinking-parallel_evidence-1907", "run_id": "bc4c140538d4403b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我已经有了足够的信息。让我总结采集到的事实：\n\n## 已采集事实、冲突和缺口\n\n### 实体确认\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4`，UID `6d7ef0ba-939d-4371-a7d9-b332d976d782`\n- **节点**: `node2` (10.2.0.50)，IP `172.16.104.16`\n- **控制器**: ReplicaSet `workload-65b7f54794` → Deployment `workload`\n\n### 支持\"ImagePullFailed\"的证据（确凿）\n1. **kubectl describe**: Pod 状态 `Pending`，container `app` 的 Image 为 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`，reason=`ImagePullBackOff`\n2. **kubectl events**: \n   - `Failed to pull image`: \"failed to reso", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788410101149, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

